| Change | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **Icon Layout** | Created a vertical left column with `flex flex-col items-center gap-1` containing all 4 icons |
| **Main Container** | Changed from horizontal flex to `flex gap-2` to separate icon column from content |
| **Icons Grouped** | ProjectIcon, loading/ChatIcon, status icon, and read indicator now stack vertically on the left |
| **Content Area** | Wrapped name, description, and timestamp in a content div that flexes to fill remaining space |
| **Icon Column** | Added `shrink-0` to prevent the column from compressing |
| **Removed Padding** | Removed `pl-5` from description and timestamp since they're now in their own content area |

